{"title":"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solve <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/2/c323b760b58adfa04e8b65227faed0727f24e64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\underbrace{\\overline{aa\\ldots a}}_{\\text{2k}} - \\underbrace{\\overline{bb\\ldots b}}_{\\text{k}}=(\\underbrace{\\overline{cc\\ldots c}}_{\\text{k}})^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"222\" height=\"39\" />\n, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/5/aa523911acabdd784ea4736cf8d3d9267fe561dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\underbrace{\\overline{cc\\ldots c}}_{\\text{k}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -25px\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\" />\ndenotes a number with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> digits each one\nequal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II\">2015 UNM-PNM Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://mathcontest.unm.edu/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>last question</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_I